          "_name": "article08",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"guide-executive-section\" id=\"ukraine-orientation-guide\">\n    <div class=\"executive-container\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"guide-header\">\n            <span class=\"header-tag mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Practical Knowledge Base</span>\n            <h1 class=\"header-title mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-2\">Orientation Guide for Families from Ukraine</h1>\n            <p class=\"header-lead mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                Clear, straightforward explanations of essential German terms, procedures, and official requirements you will encounter during your first year.\n            </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- General Disclaimer (Emerald) -->\n        <div class=\"disclaimer-banner\">\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-icon\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"disclaimer-text mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">\n                <strong>General Information Notice:</strong> This guide is designed to help you understand the overall landscape before starting procedures. Rules and regulations vary across cities, local authorities, and individual residency statuses, and are updated periodically. This content does not constitute legal advice or a substitute for direct verification with competent official authorities.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 01: Address and Authorities -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                <span class=\"step-number\">01</span> \n                Registration and Public Authorities\n            </h2>\n            \n            <!-- Anmeldung -->\n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Anmeldung — Address Registration</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag mandatory mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Mandatory First Step</span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>What it is:</strong> The official declaration of your residential address to the local municipality (Bürgeramt / Einwohnermeldeamt).</p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Without address registration, virtually no other administrative step can proceed — including health insurance, opening a bank account, social benefits, or school enrollment.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"card-details-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Basic Steps</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Book an appointment at the local municipal office, attend with required documents, and receive your official registration certificate (Meldebestätigung).</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Common Documents</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Valid passport/ID card, landlord confirmation of move-in (Wohnungsgeberbestätigung), and completed registration form.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"warning-callout mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">\n                    <strong>Common Mistakes:</strong> Delaying registration beyond required deadlines, attending without the landlord's signed confirmation, or failing to update your registration when moving apartments.\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"contact-trigger\">\n                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg>\n                    <span class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>When to contact us:</strong> When requirements are unclear, documents are missing, or available appointment dates are too far in the future.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Jobcenter -->\n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Jobcenter</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag info mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Living Expenses and Housing</span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>What it is:</strong> The government authority responsible for managing living allowance assistance, housing cost coverage, and employment integration support for eligible individuals.</p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> In many cases, the Jobcenter must pre-approve housing expenses before a rental agreement is finalized, making them a key stakeholder in your relocation process.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"card-details-grid\">\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Basic Steps</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Initial registration/application submission, submitting verified supporting documentation, attending scheduled appointments, and tracking official written communications.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"detail-box\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Common Mistakes</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Failing to reply to official letters within stated deadlines, not reporting changes in personal circumstances, or assuming that receiving no response means everything is fine.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"notice-highlight mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">\n                    <strong>Important to understand:</strong> All final decisions rest exclusively with the Jobcenter. Our role is to explain requirements and accompany you through the process, not to make administrative determinations.\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"contact-trigger\">\n                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg>\n                    <span class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>When to contact us:</strong> When you receive official letters you cannot understand, before critical appointments, or during the apartment approval phase.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Apartment Approval -->\n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <div class=\"card-header\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Apartment Approval (Wohnungsbeschaffung)</h3>\n                    <span class=\"status-tag critical mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Crucial Step</span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>What it is:</strong> Official pre-approval confirming that a prospective rental apartment meets designated standards regarding total size and rental price limits.</p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>Why it matters:</strong> Signing a lease contract before receiving formal approval may leave you personally liable for rental commitments that are not covered by social allowances.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"warning-callout mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">\n                    <strong>Golden Rule:</strong> Never sign a lease agreement before your apartment approval status is fully confirmed.\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"contact-trigger\">\n                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg>\n                    <span class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>When to contact us:</strong> Always contact us <em>before</em> signing the contract. Reversing an executed lease is extremely difficult.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary\" href=\"glossary.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                    Explore Full Official Glossary of Terms\n                </a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 02: Education and Family -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                <span class=\"step-number\">02</span> \n                Education and Childcare\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid-2\">\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">School Enrollment (Schule)</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>Basic Steps:</strong> Apply through the local education authority or directly at the designated school, present required documents, attend an assessment interview, and evaluate language placement needs.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>Common Documents:</strong> Address registration certificate (Meldebestätigung), parent and child identity documents, official vaccination records (measles immunization), and previous school records if available.</p>\n                    <div class=\"warning-callout mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">\n                        <strong>Common Mistake:</strong> Waiting until the formal start of the school year instead of contacting educational authorities early to explore language support classes (Willkommensklassen).\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Kindergarten (Kita)</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>What to know:</strong> Childcare places are strictly limited, and long waiting lists exist in many municipalities. It is strongly advised to apply as early as possible and register across multiple institutions simultaneously whenever permitted.</p>\n                    <div class=\"contact-trigger\">\n                        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg>\n                        <span class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>When to contact us:</strong> At the very start of your search, before encountering multiple rejections.</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                <a class=\"btn btn-outline-primary display-4\" href=\"learning-german.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                    Read Full Language and Education Guide\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 03: Essential Daily Services -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                <span class=\"step-number\">03</span> \n                Financial, Medical and Daily Services\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid-3\">\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Health Insurance</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Health insurance is mandatory in Germany. Without it, access to medical services is severely restricted. Keep your insurance card safe and inform your insurer immediately of any address or family status changes.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"5\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"10\"></line></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Bank Account</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Necessary for virtually all financial transactions — receiving support/salary, paying rent, and utility bills. Requires a valid identity document and your address registration certificate (Meldebestätigung).</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"3\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"15\"></line><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"11\"></line><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Public Transit</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Upper Franconia features a regional bus and train network. In smaller towns, schedules run less frequently than in big cities — advance planning is crucial for official appointments.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Emergency Box 112/110 -->\n            <div class=\"emergency-box\">\n                <div class=\"emergency-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z\"></path></svg>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"emergency-content\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Emergency Numbers in Germany</h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Dial <strong>112</strong> for Medical Emergencies and Fire Department.<br>Dial <strong>110</strong> for Police assistance.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 04: Housing and Contracts -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                <span class=\"step-number\">04</span> \n                Housing Contracts and Utilities\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"guide-card\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Lease Agreements and Security Deposits</h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>Key factors before signing:</strong> Understand the exact difference between basic rent (Kaltmiete) and total rent including heating/utilities (Warmmiete). Verify what is included, the security deposit amount (Kaution), repayment conditions, and mandatory lease cancellation notice periods.</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"warning-callout mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">\n                    <strong>Common Mistakes:</strong> Signing a binding lease without full comprehension, failing to document apartment handover condition (Übergabeprotokoll) upon move-in, or transferring cash deposits without an official written receipt.\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"contact-trigger\">\n                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line><polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline></svg>\n                    <span class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>When to contact us:</strong> Always before signing. Once signed, lease terms are legally binding and cannot be easily modified.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid-2\">\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Electricity, Gas and Heating</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">In most cases, residents sign separate individual contracts with utility providers. Monthly payments are estimated advance instalments; at year-end, actual consumption is calculated, resulting in either a refund or an additional payment balance.</p>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem; font-style:italic; margin-top:10px;\">Tip: Always record meter readings on move-in day and update your address with utility suppliers.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Internet and Telecom</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Many German telecom contracts carry fixed minimum terms (often up to 24 months) and renew automatically. Pay close attention to contract cancellation deadlines and notice periods prior to signing.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 05: Official Communication and Integration -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                <span class=\"step-number\">05</span> \n                Mail, Integration and Rights\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"rule-box mail-rule\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                    <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z\"></path><polyline points=\"22,6 12,13 2,6\"></polyline></svg>\n                    Golden Rule for Official Letters in Germany\n                </h3>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">In Germany, an official letter is never a suggestion. Letters almost always contain strict response deadlines, and non-response is legally interpreted as tacit agreement or refusal.</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Open all mail immediately upon receipt.</li>\n                    <li class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Check for explicit response deadlines or appointment dates.</li>\n                    <li class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Keep a copy of every document sent or received.</li>\n                    <li class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\"><strong>If you do not understand a letter:</strong> Take a clear photo and send it to our team immediately.</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid-3\">\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">German Language Courses</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Language is the ultimate key to independence. Integration courses (Integrationskurs) and language classes are available, with eligibility depending on your legal status and local municipality.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Employment &amp; Recognition</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Job market integration depends heavily on language proficiency and formal recognition of Ukrainian qualifications/diplomas. Start qualification recognition procedures early.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-mini-card\">\n                    <div class=\"mini-icon\">\n                        <svg width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Doctors and Pharmacies</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Start by seeing a general practitioner (Hausarzt), who issues referrals to specialists. Pharmacies (Apotheken) operate regular hours, with scheduled emergency services (Notdienst) at night and weekends.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Section 06: Tenant Rights and Documentation -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-5\">\n                <span class=\"step-number\">06</span> \n                Rights, Obligations and Record Keeping\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid-2\">\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Tenant Rights and Obligations</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Tenants in Germany enjoy strong legal protections, but also have strict responsibilities: punctual rent payment, property care, adhering to quiet hours (Ruhezeiten), and proper waste separation. Understanding these rules prevents most disputes.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"guide-subcard\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Address Change &amp; Archiving</h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Whenever you move, you must notify the registration office, Jobcenter, health insurer, bank, and service providers. Maintain a physical folder with all original documents and keep digital photo copies on your phone.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Deep Dive Navigation Section -->\n        <div class=\"deep-dive-section\">\n            <h2 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Looking for In-Depth Guides?</h2>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Choose a specific topic below to learn exactly how the systems work, what your rights are, and how to navigate German bureaucracy.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"glossary.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                    Official Glossary\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"learning-german.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                    Language &amp; Education\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"refugee-rights.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                    Refugee Rights\n                </a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Direct Action CTA (WhatsApp) -->\n        <div class=\"guide-cta-box\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style display-5\">Have Questions About a Specific Procedure or Letter?</h3>\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">Reach out to our team directly via WhatsApp for practical guidance and local support.</p>\n            \n                <div class=\"mbr-section-btn cta-buttons-wrapper\" mbr-buttons=\"true\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><a class=\"btn custom-btn whatsapp-btn display-4 btn-warning\" href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.38 8.38 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.38 8.38 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.38 8.38 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.48 8.48 0 0 1 8 8v.5z\"></path></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Anna\n                    </a></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"final-clarification mbr-text mbr-fonts-style display-7\">\n            <strong>Formal Disclaimer:</strong> The information contained on this page is for general orientation purposes only and does not constitute formal legal counsel. Administrative procedures vary between cities and authorities and are subject to change. Always verify specific details directly with competent local authorities or official sources.\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vqdQilZ178",
          "_anchor": "article08-1x",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 56px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 22px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 22px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "space-between"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem",
              "img": {
                "width": "(@logoWidth * 1px)",
                "max-width": "100%",
                "height": "auto",
                "object-fit": "contain"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              }
            },
            ".lists-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "1rem",
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              },
              ".list-wrap": {
                ".list": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "list-style-type": "none",
                  ".item-wrap": {
                    "margin-bottom": "8px",
                    "cursor": "pointer",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    },
                    "&:last-child": {
                      "margin-bottom": "0"
                    },
                    "&:hover, &:focus": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".copy-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "& when (@showBorder)": {
                "border-top": "1px solid @border",
                "padding-top": "16px"
              },
              "& when not (@showSocial)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "& when not (@showCopy)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block"
              },
              ".social-wrapper": {
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "16px"
                },
                ".social-wrap": {
                  "display": "inline-flex",
                  "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                  ".soc-item": {
                    "margin-left": "32px",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "margin-left": "0"
                    },
                    "a": {
                      "display": "block",
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "color": "@active"
                        }
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "16px",
                        "color": "@socColor",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".mbr-copy": {
                "width": "50%",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ff5753"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".list": {
              "color": "#635d60"
            },
            ".mbr-copy": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".list, .item-wrap": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "scalem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer01 scalem5\" group=\"Footer\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Logo Width\" name=\"logoWidth\" min=\"50\" max=\"400\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Lists\" name=\"showLists\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Amount\" name=\"list\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"showLists\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"List Active Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"activeList\" condition=\"showLists\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Social Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"socColor\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Active Color\" value=\"#FF5753\" name=\"active\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#635d60\" name=\"border\" condition=\"showBorder\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0c2c68\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#292325\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            \n            <!-- עמודת טקסט וכותרת ראשית -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons || showLogo\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <!-- תוספת המקום ללוגו -->\n                    <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>\n                        ZUSAMMENLEBEN\n                    </b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                        Supporting integration, housing, and community connection for newcomers and locals in the area.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-phone mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                            Contact Us\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- עמודות הקישורים -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\" mbr-if=\"showLists\">\n                <div class=\"lists-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Home</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"family-stories.html\" class=\"text-white\">Family Stories</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"services.html\" class=\"text-white\">Services</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"request-assistance.html\" class=\"text-white\">Request Assistance</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"community.html\" class=\"text-white\">Community</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 1\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"living-in-germany.html\" class=\"text-white\">Living in Germany</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"glossary.html\" class=\"text-white\">Glossary</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"learning-german.html\" class=\"text-white\">Learning German</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"refugee-rights.html\" class=\"text-white\">Refugee Rights</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" class=\"text-white\">Anna Shishoili</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 2\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"how-to-help.html\" class=\"text-white\">How Can You Help</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"social-activity.html\" class=\"text-white\">Social Activity</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"faq.html\" class=\"text-white\">FAQ</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Areas We Serve</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 3\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"emergency.html\" class=\"text-white\">Emergency</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"Contact.html\" class=\"text-white\">Contact</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" class=\"text-white\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp Support</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Location</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 4\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Impressum</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Official Site</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- אזור זכויות יוצרים ורשתות חברתיות -->\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showSocial || showCopy\">\n                <div class=\"copy-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"social-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <div class=\"social-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                <a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-whatsapp\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 1\">\n                                <a href=\"mailto:info@zusammenleben.de\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-copy mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-copy, .social-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\">\n                        © Copyright 2026 Zusammenleben - All Rights Reserved\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "footer01-2b",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqpoIpWKp1",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "footers",
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    "request-assistance.html": {
      "settings": {
        "title": "Request Assistance",
        "order": "4"
      },
      "components": [
        {
          "_name": "amenu1",
          "_sourceTheme": "solarm5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when (@sticky)": {
              "position": "sticky !important",
              "top": "0 !important",
              "z-index": "1030 !important",
              "width": "100%",
              "nav.navbar, .navbar-dropdown, .navbar-fixed-top": {
                "position": "relative !important"
              }
            },
            "& when not (@sticky)": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "1030",
              ".navbar-dropdown": {
                "position": "relative !important"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                ".navbar-dropdown": {
                  "position": "absolute !important"
                }
              }
            },
            "body": {
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".navbar": {
              "min-height": "80px",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "border-bottom": "1px solid transparent",
              "& when not (@transparent)": {
                "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)",
                "background": "@menuBgColor"
              },
              "& when (@transparent)": {
                "background": "rgba(red(@menuBgColor), green(@menuBgColor), blue(@menuBgColor), @opacity)"
              },
              "&.opened": {
                "transition": "all 0.3s"
              },
              ".navbar-logo img": {
                "width": "auto"
              },
              "&.navbar-short": {
                "min-height": "60px",
                ".navbar-logo img": {
                  "height": "2.5rem !important"
                },
                ".navbar-brand": {
                  "min-height": "60px",
                  "padding": "0"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container, .container-fluid": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "margin": "auto",
              "align-items": "center"
            },
            ".brand-container": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "padding-bottom": "4px",
              "padding-top": "4px",
              "width": "100%"
            },
            ".navbar-brand": {
              "min-height": "60px",
              "flex-shrink": "0",
              "align-items": "center",
              "margin-right": "0",
              "padding": "5px 0",
              "transition": "all 0.3s",
              "word-break": "break-word",
              "z-index": "1",
              "display": "flex",
              ".navbar-caption": {
                "line-height": "inherit !important"
              },
              ".navbar-logo a": {
                "outline": "none"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".brand-container": {
                "width": "auto",
                "flex-grow": "1",
                "justify-content": "flex-start"
              },
              ".navbar-brand": {
                "padding-right": "20px"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "padding-top": "10px",
                "padding-bottom": "10px",
                "display": "flex !important",
                "flex-basis": "auto",
                ".navbar-nav": {
                  "margin": "0 -0.5em",
                  "flex-grow": "1",
                  "justify-content": "flex-end"
                },
                ".mbr-section-btn": {
                  "margin-left": "auto"
                }
              },
              ".desktop-only-flex": {
                "display": "flex !important",
                "justify-content": "flex-end",
                "align-items": "center",
                "gap": "3px",
                "flex-wrap": "nowrap",
                "margin-left": "auto",
                "padding-right": "20px"
              },
              ".mobile-only": {
                "display": "none !important"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".navbar": {
                "min-height": "60px !important"
              },
              ".desktop-only-flex": {
                "display": "none !important"
              },
              ".mobile-only": {
                "display": "flex !important",
                "align-items": "center",
                "gap": "3px",
                "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)",
                "padding": "2px 5px",
                "border-radius": "20px",
                "border": "1px solid #eaeaea",
                "margin-left": "auto",
                "margin-right": "8px"
              },
              ".navbar-brand": {
                "flex-shrink": "initial",
                "flex-basis": "auto",
                "word-break": "break-word",
                "padding-right": "0.5rem",
                "min-height": "50px"
              },
              ".navbar-logo img": {
                "height": "2.3rem !important"
              },
              ".navbar-collapse": {
                "padding-top": "2px !important",
                "padding-bottom": "5px !important",
                "border-top": "1px solid #dddddd",
                "background": "@menuBgColor"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-item": {
                "margin": "0 !important"
              },
              ".navbar-nav .nav-link": {
                "padding": "0.2rem 0.4rem !important",
                "font-size": "0.82rem !important",
                "margin": "0 !important",
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              ".dropdown-menu .dropdown-item": {
                "padding": "0.25rem 0.8rem !important",
                "font-size": "0.78rem !important",
                "margin": "0 !important",
                "text-align": "center"
              },
              ".mbr-section-btn": {
                "display": "flex",
                "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                "justify-content": "center",
                "padding": "2px 0",
                ".btn": {
                  "padding": "0.35rem 0.8rem !important",
                  "font-size": "0.82rem !important",
                  "flex-grow": "1",
                  "margin": "4px 15px"
                }
              },
              "nav.opened .dropdown-menu": {
                "top": "0"
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-menu, .navbar.opened": {
              "background": "@menuBgColor !important"
            },
            ".dropdown-menu": {
              "padding": "0",
              "border-radius": "4px",
              "box-shadow": "0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)"
            },
            ".dropdown-item": {
              "border-bottom": "1px solid #e6e6e6",
              "padding": "0.5rem 1.8rem",
              "transition": "all 0.25s ease-in-out",
              "&:hover, &:focus": {
                "background": "@primaryColor !important",
                "color": "white !important"
              },
              "&:hover span": {
                "color": "white"
              },
              "&:first-child": {
                "border-top-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-top-right-radius": "4px"
              },
              "&:last-child": {
                "border-bottom": "none",
                "border-bottom-left-radius": "4px",
                "border-bottom-right-radius": "4px"
              }
            },
            ".dropdown-item.active, .dropdown-item:active": {
              "background-color": "transparent"
            },
            "a.nav-link": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "transition": "all 0.2s",
              "&:hover": {
                "color": "@primaryColor !important"
              }
            },
            "ul.navbar-nav": {
              "flex-wrap": "wrap"
            },
            ".nav-item:focus, .nav-link:focus": {
              "outline": "none"
            },
            ".navbar-buttons": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "min-width": "150px"
            },
            ".card-wrap": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "padding": "2px 4px",
              "min-width": "auto"
            },
            ".contacts-menu .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".contacts-menu .menu-divider": {
              "color": "#ccc",
              "font-weight": "300",
              "margin": "0 1px"
            },
            ".desktop-only-flex .mbr-iconfont": {
              "color": "@iconsContactColor"
            },
            ".flags-menu": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "5px",
              "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03)",
              "padding": "3px 8px",
              "border-radius": "20px",
              "border": "1px solid #eaeaea"
            },
            ".lang-link": {
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "gap": "3px",
              "text-decoration": "none !important",
              "transition": "transform 0.2s ease",
              "&:hover": {
                "transform": "scale(1.08)"
              }
            },
            ".lang-code": {
              "font-size": "10px",
              "font-weight": "700",
              "color": "#333",
              "letter-spacing": "0.5px"
            },
            ".flag-divider": {
              "color": "#ccc",
              "font-size": "11px"
            },
            "button.navbar-toggler": {
              "outline": "none",
              "width": "28px",
              "height": "18px",
              "cursor": "pointer",
              "transition": "all 0.2s",
              "position": "relative",
              "align-self": "center",
              "flex-basis": "auto",
              ".hamburger span": {
                "position": "absolute",
                "right": "0",
                "width": "26px",
                "height": "2px",
                "border-right": "5px",
                "background-color": "@hamburgerColor",
                "&:nth-child(1)": {
                  "top": "0",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(2)": {
                  "top": "6px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(3)": {
                  "top": "6px",
                  "transition": "all 0.15s"
                },
                "&:nth-child(4)": {
                  "top": "12px",
                  "transition": "all 0.2s"
                }
              }
            },
            "nav.opened .hamburger span": {
              "&:nth-child(1)": {
                "top": "6px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(2)": {
                "transform": "rotate(45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(3)": {
                "transform": "rotate(-45deg)",
                "transition": "all 0.25s"
              },
              "&:nth-child(4)": {
                "top": "6px",
                "width": "0",
                "opacity": "0",
                "right": "50%",
                "transition": "all 0.2s"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"menu menu1\" group=\"Menu\" plugins=\"DropDown, TouchSwipe\" global once=\"menu\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\" checked>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Logo Size\" inline name=\"logoSize\" min=\"3\" max=\"8\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"3\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Brand Name\" name=\"showBrand\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Contact Phone\" name=\"showPhone\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Contact Address\" name=\"showAddress\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Contact Icons Color\" name=\"iconsContactColor\" value=\"#0c2c68\" condition=\"showPhone || showAddress\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Menu Items\" name=\"showItems\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcons\">\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"iconsAmount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icons Color\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#222222\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Button\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <header>Styles</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Sticky\" name=\"sticky\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Collapsed\" name=\"collapsed\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Transparent\" name=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Opacity\" name=\"opacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"transparent\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"menuBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Hamburger\" name=\"hamburgerColor\" value=\"#222222\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <nav class=\"navbar navbar-dropdown\" mbr-class=\"{'navbar-fixed-top':sticky,\n                 'navbar-expand-lg':!collapsed,\n                 'collapsed':collapsed}\">\n        <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n            <div class=\"brand-container\">\n                <div class=\"navbar-brand\">\n                <span mbr-if=\"showLogo\" class=\"navbar-logo\">\n                    <a href=\"index.html\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\" mbr-style=\"{'height': logoSize + 'rem'}\">\n                    </a>\n                </span>\n                    <span mbr-if=\"showBrand\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"navbar-caption-wrap\"><a class=\"navbar-caption text-black\" data-app-selector=\".navbar-caption\" href=\"index.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Zusammen Leben</a></span>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- פרטי קשר + דגלים (מוצגים אך ורק במחשב) -->\n                <div class=\"contacts-menu desktop-only-flex\">\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap\">\n                        <span class=\"mobi-mbri-phone mobi-mbri\" style=\"font-size: 18px;\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0 display-4\"><a href=\"tel:+380 63 700 4615\" class=\"text-primary\">+380 63 700 4615</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    <span class=\"menu-divider\">|</span>\n\n                    <div class=\"card-wrap\">\n                        <span class=\"mdi-maps-place\" style=\"font-size: 22px;\"></span>\n                        <div class=\"card-box\">\n                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-0 display-4\">Konradsreuth Alte Hofer Str. 1</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <span class=\"menu-divider\">|</span>\n\n                    <div class=\"flags-menu\">\n                        <a href=\"#\" title=\"Deutsch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n                            <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/de.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/de.png 2x\" alt=\"Germany\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n                            <span class=\"lang-code\">DE</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"#\" title=\"English\" class=\"lang-link\">\n                            <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/us.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/us.png 2x\" alt=\"United States\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n                            <span class=\"lang-code\">EN</span>\n                        </a>\n                        <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n                        <a href=\"#\" title=\"Українська\" class=\"lang-link\">\n                            <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/ua.png\" srcset=\"https://flagcdn.com/48x36/ua.png 2x\" alt=\"Ukraine\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n                            <span class=\"lang-code\">UA</span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- דגלים בלבד שיופיעו אך ורק בטלפון ליד ההמבורגר -->\n                <div class=\"flags-menu mobile-only\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" title=\"Deutsch\" class=\"lang-link\">\n                        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/de.png\" alt=\"DE\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n                    </a>\n                    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n                    <a href=\"#\" title=\"English\" class=\"lang-link\">\n                        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/us.png\" alt=\"EN\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n                    </a>\n                    <span class=\"flag-divider\">|</span>\n                    <a href=\"#\" title=\"Українська\" class=\"lang-link\">\n                        <img src=\"https://flagcdn.com/24x18/ua.png\" alt=\"UA\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\">\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n\n                <button class=\"navbar-toggler\" type=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" data-bs-target=\"#navbarSupportedContent\" aria-controls=\"navbarNavAltMarkup\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\" mbr-if=\"showItems || showIcons || showButtons\">\n                    <div class=\"hamburger\">\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                        <span></span>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"collapse navbar-collapse\" id=\"navbarSupportedContent\" mbr-scroll-collapse>\n                <ul class=\"navbar-nav nav-dropdown\" data-app-modern-menu=\"true\" mbr-menu><li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"index.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Home</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">About Us</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"social-activity.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Our Activity</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Anna Shishoili</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"services.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Services</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"request-assistance.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Request Assistance</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Living in Germany</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"glossary.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Glossary</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"learning-german.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learning German</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"refugee-rights.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Rights of Ukrainian Refugees</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"areasweserve.html#amenu1-1m\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Areas We Serve</a>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item dropdown\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link dropdown-toggle display-4 text-primary\" href=\"#\" data-toggle=\"dropdown-submenu\" data-bs-toggle=\"dropdown\" data-bs-auto-close=\"outside\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Community</a>\n                        <div class=\"dropdown-menu\">\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"our-community.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Our Community</a>\n                            <a class=\"dropdown-item display-4 text-primary\" href=\"family-stories.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Family Stories</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </li>\n\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"faq.html#list01-b\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">FAQ</a>\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link display-4 text-primary\" href=\"how-to-help.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">How Can you Help</a>\n                    </li>\n    \n                    <!-- Emergency - Highlighted in a separate prominent color -->\n                    <li class=\"nav-item\">\n                        <a class=\"nav-link link font-weight-bold display-4 text-primary\" href=\"emergency.html\" style=\"color: #ff3333 !important;\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Emergency</a>\n                    </li></ul>\n                \n                <div mbr-if=\"showButtons\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"navbar-buttons mbr-section-btn\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary display-4\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Contact Us</a></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</section>",
