statement / Billing</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Nachzahlung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Additional payment due</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Rückzahlung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Refund</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Internetanschluss</div><div class=\"word-en\">Internet connection</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Rundfunkbeitrag</div><div class=\"word-en\">Broadcasting fee (mandatory)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Hausordnung</div><div class=\"word-en\">House rules</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Ruhezeit</div><div class=\"word-en\">Quiet hours</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Mülltrennung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Waste separation</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Nachbar</div><div class=\"word-en\">Neighbor</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Hausmeister</div><div class=\"word-en\">Caretaker / Janitor</div></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Category 3 -->\n        <div class=\"category-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"category-title\">\n                <span class=\"cat-icon dict-svg-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"2\" y=\"7\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M16 21V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                3. Money, Work, Banking and Insurance\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"word-grid\">\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Bank</div><div class=\"word-en\">Bank<