\">Minijob</div><div class=\"word-en\">Marginal part-time job</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Vollzeit</div><div class=\"word-en\">Full-time</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Teilzeit</div><div class=\"word-en\">Part-time</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Gehalt</div><div class=\"word-en\">Salary</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Lohn</div><div class=\"word-en\">Wage</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">brutto</div><div class=\"word-en\">Gross (before taxes)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">netto</div><div class=\"word-en\">Net (after taxes)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Steuer</div><div class=\"word-en\">Tax</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Steuerklasse</div><div class=\"word-en\">Tax class / bracket</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Anerkennung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Recognition (of qualifications)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Zeugnis</div><div class=\"word-en\">Certificate / Diploma</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Praktikum</div><div class=\"word-en\">Internship</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Ausbildung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Vocational training</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Krankenkasse</div><div class=\"word-en\">Health insurance fund</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Krankenversicherung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Health insurance</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Versicherungskarte</div><div class=\"word-en\">Health insurance card</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Haftpflichtversicherung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Third-party liability insurance</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Beitrag</div><div class=\"word-en\">Contribution / Premium</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Vertrag</div><div class=\"word-en\">Contract</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Mahnung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Payment reminder / Warning</div></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Category 4 -->\n        <div class=\"category-block\">\n            <h2 class=\"category-title\">\n                <span class=\"cat-icon dict-svg-icon\">\n                    <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"/></svg>\n                </span>\n                4. Health, Education, Emergencies and Daily Life\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"word-grid\">\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Notruf</div><div class=\"word-en\">Emergency call</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Notaufnahme</div><div class=\"word-en\">Emergency room</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Krankenwagen</div><div class=\"word-en\">Ambulance</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Feuerwehr</div><div class=\"word-en\">Fire department</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Polizei</div><div class=\"word-en\">Police</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Notfall</div><div class=\"word-en\">Emergency</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Hilfe!</div><div class=\"word-en\">Help!</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Gefahr</div><div class=\"word-en\">Danger</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Unfall</div><div class=\"word-en\">Accident</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Arzt / Ärztin</div><div class=\"word-en\">Doctor (male / female)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Hausarzt</div><div class=\"word-en\">General practitioner (GP)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Kinderarzt</div><div class=\"word-en\">Pediatrician</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Facharzt</div><div class=\"word-en\">Specialist doctor</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Überweisung (Medical)</div><div class=\"word-en\">Referral to a specialist</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Praxis</div><div class=\"word-en\">Doctor's office / Clinic</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Krankenhaus / Klinikum</div><div class=\"word-en\">Hospital</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Apotheke</div><div class=\"word-en\">Pharmacy</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Notdienstapotheke</div><div class=\"word-en\">Emergency/On-call pharmacy</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Rezept</div><div class=\"word-en\">Prescription</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Medikament</div><div class=\"word-en\">Medication</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Impfung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Vaccination</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Impfpass</div><div class=\"word-en\">Vaccination record booklet</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Schmerzen</div><div class=\"word-en\">Pain</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Fieber</div><div class=\"word-en\">Fever</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">krank</div><div class=\"word-en\">Sick / Ill</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Krankschreibung</div><div class=\"word-en\">Sick leave certificate</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Schwangerschaft</div><div class=\"word-en\">Pregnancy</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Zahnarzt</div><div class=\"word-en\">Dentist</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Schule</div><div class=\"word-en\">School</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Grundschule</div><div class=\"word-en\">Primary school</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Kindergarten</div><div class=\"word-en\">Kindergarten</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Kita</div><div class=\"word-en\">Daycare center (abbreviation)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Schulanmeldung</div><div class=\"word-en\">School enrollment</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Klasse</div><div class=\"word-en\">Class / Grade</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Lehrer / Lehrerin</div><div class=\"word-en\">Teacher (male / female)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Elternabend</div><div class=\"word-en\">Parents' evening / meeting</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Hausaufgaben</div><div class=\"word-en\">Homework</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Ferien</div><div class=\"word-en\">School holidays</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Willkommensklasse</div><div class=\"word-en\">Welcome class (for new students)</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Sprachkurs</div><div class=\"word-en\">Language course</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Integrationskurs</div><div class=\"word-en\">Integration course</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Volkshochschule (VHS)</div><div class=\"word-en\">Adult education center</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Supermarkt</div><div class=\"word-en\">Supermarket</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Öffnungszeiten</div><div class=\"word-en\">Opening hours</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">geschlossen</div><div class=\"word-en\">Closed</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Feiertag</div><div class=\"word-en\">Public holiday</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Bahnhof</div><div class=\"word-en\">Train station</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Fahrkarte</div><div class=\"word-en\">Ticket</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Fahrplan</div><div class=\"word-en\">Timetable / Schedule</div></div>\n                <div class=\"word-item\"><div class=\"word-de\">Führerschein</div><div class=\"word-en\">Driver's license</div></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Disclaimer -->\n        <div class=\"dict-disclaimer\">\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.85rem; color: #64748b; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This glossary is provided for general informational purposes only to help newcomers navigate everyday terminology. Official procedures and legally binding documents should always be confirmed with licensed advisors or the respective authorities.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "features05-27",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqj6LMRbZq",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 56px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 22px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 22px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "space-between"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem",
              "img": {
                "width": "(@logoWidth * 1px)",
                "max-width": "100%",
                "height": "auto",
                "object-fit": "contain"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              }
            },
            ".lists-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "1rem",
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              },
              ".list-wrap": {
                ".list": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "list-style-type": "none",
                  ".item-wrap": {
                    "margin-bottom": "8px",
                    "cursor": "pointer",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    },
                    "&:last-child": {
                      "margin-bottom": "0"
                    },
                    "&:hover, &:focus": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".copy-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "& when (@showBorder)": {
                "border-top": "1px solid @border",
                "padding-top": "16px"
              },
              "& when not (@showSocial)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "& when not (@showCopy)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block"
              },
              ".social-wrapper": {
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "16px"
                },
                ".social-wrap": {
                  "display": "inline-flex",
                  "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                  ".soc-item": {
                    "margin-left": "32px",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "margin-left": "0"
                    },
                    "a": {
                      "display": "block",
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "color": "@active"
                        }
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "16px",
                        "color": "@socColor",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".mbr-copy": {
                "width": "50%",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ff5753"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".list": {
              "color": "#635d60"
            },
            ".mbr-copy": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".list, .item-wrap": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "scalem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer01 scalem5\" group=\"Footer\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Logo Width\" name=\"logoWidth\" min=\"50\" max=\"400\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Lists\" name=\"showLists\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Amount\" name=\"list\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"showLists\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"List Active Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"activeList\" condition=\"showLists\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Social Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"socColor\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Active Color\" value=\"#FF5753\" name=\"active\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#635d60\" name=\"border\" condition=\"showBorder\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0c2c68\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#292325\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            \n            <!-- עמודת טקסט וכותרת ראשית -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons || showLogo\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <!-- תוספת המקום ללוגו -->\n                    <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>\n                        ZUSAMMENLEBEN\n                    </b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                        Supporting integration, housing, and community connection for newcomers and locals in the area.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-phone mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                            Contact Us\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- עמודות הקישורים -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\" mbr-if=\"showLists\">\n                <div class=\"lists-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Home</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"family-stories.html\" class=\"text-white\">Family Stories</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"services.html\" class=\"text-white\">Services</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"request-assistance.html\" class=\"text-white\">Request Assistance</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"community.html\" class=\"text-white\">Community</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 1\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"living-in-germany.html\" class=\"text-white\">Living in Germany</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"glossary.html\" class=\"text-white\">Glossary</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"learning-german.html\" class=\"text-white\">Learning German</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"refugee-rights.html\" class=\"text-white\">Refugee Rights</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" class=\"text-white\">Anna Shishoili</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 2\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"how-to-help.html\" class=\"text-white\">How Can You Help</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"social-activity.html\" class=\"text-white\">Social Activity</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"faq.html\" class=\"text-white\">FAQ</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Areas We Serve</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 3\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"emergency.html\" class=\"text-white\">Emergency</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"Contact.html\" class=\"text-white\">Contact</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" class=\"text-white\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp Support</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Location</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 4\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Impressum</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Official Site</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- אזור זכויות יוצרים ורשתות חברתיות -->\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showSocial || showCopy\">\n                <div class=\"copy-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"social-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <div class=\"social-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                <a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-whatsapp\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 1\">\n                                <a href=\"mailto:info@zusammenleben.de\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-copy mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-copy, .social-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\">\n                        © Copyright 2026 Zusammenleben - All Rights Reserved\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
